{"id":"CG_161_02","names":{"1":"","avg1_110":"Firenze","avg1_161":"Leafia","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_140":"Empleado de Cosecha Unida","avg3_161":"Leafia"},"en":{"1":"","avg1_110":"Firenze","avg1_161":"Leafia","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_140":"United Harvest Employee","avg3_161":"Leafia"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Two","A Dream Day (Part II)","What did the continent look like a thousand years ago? That's certainly an interesting topic."],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.0],["bg","philae_market_daylight",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.75,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",0.75],["show","avg1_161","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["bgm","m12"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","007","attention",null,-0.25,1.3,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_161","If you really are the legendary Tyrant... I have a favor to ask.==W== Could you grant me a wish?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Ah...==W== Sorry to disappoint, but I'm not the legendary Tyrant you're looking for. Not at all.",1,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","...",0,""],["w",0.65],["ctl","avg1_161","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","sigh","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Hope she buys that. The last thing I need is to overcomplicate things...",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","I see. Then I was mistaken. Sorry.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","019","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Phew...==W== Glad she let it go. Still, what was she going to ask for...?",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012","question","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","Leafia, if I really were the legendary Tyrant, what were you going to ask for?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","007","music",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","... I wanted you to tell me about the terrain from a thousand years ago.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","The terrain from a thousand years ago?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_021"],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_side_161_002",0,null,0.6],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_161","The other day, while sorting through the Trekker Association archives, I found a partial map labeled \"Filanis.\"",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_055"],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Filanis...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_252"],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["objx"],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_161","a","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Mikan said Philae was known as Filanis a thousand years ago.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Which means this map shows what Philae looked like back then.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","014","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","But the map is compromised. The section for the Lake Island is missing...==W== If I'd never seen it, I wouldn't be this obsessed.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","017","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But now that you've seen a piece of it, your curiosity is eating at you, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Exactly...==W== So I figured the legendary Tyrant who lived through that era would know what Philae looked like back then.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Makes sense. So that's why you pulled me aside to ask.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","I apologize for being so presumptuous. Logically, no one from a thousand years ago could still be alive...==W== Please forget I brought it up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","She looks so disappointed. She must have really gotten her hopes up.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Is there anything I can do...==W== Oh, that's it!",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","002","idea","lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012","attention","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","Leafia, I may not be the Tyrant, but I might still be able to help.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"diantou"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","013","symbol",null,-0.325,1.4,null,null,"OutQuad",0.35],["say","avg1_161","Really?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Yeah. I read a lot of books in my downtime, hoping to trigger my memory.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","And I'm pretty sure one of them was all about ancient Filanis—",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,"star",null,-0.475,1.6,null,"jingxia","OutQuad",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg1_161","Are you serious?! Did it have a map?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","007","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","Wh-Whoa, too close!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_019"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"niunie1"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"niunie1"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Boss, please try to remember. If the Tyrant isn't real, that book is my only hope.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","vexation","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","I'm trying! But it's hard when you're shaking me!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_061"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","017",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,"JuGong","OutQuint",0.5],["say","avg1_161","S-Sorry. I got carried away. Take your time, but please hurry up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","That makes zero sense...",1,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I've never seen her this worked up. I'd better not let her down.",2,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m149"],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["bg","phylanis_street_inside_daylight",0,1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",6.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","012","think",null],["say","avg3_100","The Lake Island a thousand years ago...==W== Back then, it was basically the equivalent of today's Gold District.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Well...==W== If I remember correctly, the Lake Island used to be where the Filanis nobles lived.",1,""],["w",0.